IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. PROG-DVFS-PROFILE.

DATA DIVISION.
01 WALL-TIME-MS        PIC 9(9) USAGE R0.
01 SYSTEM-LOAD-PCT     PIC 9(9) USAGE R1.
01 DVFS-FREQ-MHZ       PIC 9(9) USAGE R2.
01 MEM-BW-GBPS-X10     PIC 9(9) USAGE R3.

PROCEDURE DIVISION.
MAIN-DVFS.
    IF SYSTEM-LOAD-PCT == 0
        MOVE 50 TO SYSTEM-LOAD-PCT.
    END-IF.

    # Scaled math for 2800 * (1.0 - load * 0.20):
    # With load=50 (0.50): factor = 100 - (50 * 20 / 100) = 90.
    # 2800 * 90 / 100 = 2520.
    MOVE SYSTEM-LOAD-PCT TO R14.
    MULTIPLY 20 BY R14.
    DIVIDE 100 INTO R14.
    MOVE 100 TO DVFS-FREQ-MHZ.
    SUBTRACT R14 FROM DVFS-FREQ-MHZ.
    MULTIPLY 2800 BY DVFS-FREQ-MHZ.
    DIVIDE 100 INTO DVFS-FREQ-MHZ.

    MOVE SYSTEM-LOAD-PCT TO R14.
    MULTIPLY 15 BY R14.
    DIVIDE 100 INTO R14.
    MOVE 100 TO MEM-BW-GBPS-X10.
    ADD R14 TO MEM-BW-GBPS-X10.
    MULTIPLY 425 BY MEM-BW-GBPS-X10.
    DIVIDE 100 INTO MEM-BW-GBPS-X10.

    SET depth 2.
    WEIGHT 32 DVFS-FREQ-MHZ.
    WEIGHT 30 MEM-BW-GBPS-X10.
    EVAL.
    PRUNE 10.
    GO TO END-STRATEGY.

END-STRATEGY.
